      "message": "Because `initDecoration()` is asynchronous while awaiting `initProperties()`, an in-flight decoration that started before `this.hasReplacement` was set will still append its element into the DOM when its promise resolves. Should `initDecoration()` (or `initModule`\u0027s resolved callback) also check `if (this.hasReplacement)` before appending the element and attaching the DOM hook?",
